sentences.text:
The above privilege is, however, subject to the following conditions:
1. That the applicant shall make himself available for interrogation by the Investigating Officer as and when required;
2. That the applicant shall not, directly or indirectly, make any inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the case so as to dissuade him from disclosing such facts to the Court or to any police officer; and Page No.# 4/4 3.

